# Build context for deployments/docker/Dockerfile.web (context = ./web).
# All three apps share this context; each image COPYs only its own ${APP} dir.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage

# Local env. Next bakes .env* into the build; runtime config must come from the
# container environment instead, so keep every .env out of the image. (.env.example
# is kept only as in-context documentation and is never read by `next build`.)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.eslintcache
